### Registro válido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ana",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login válido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Obtener reseñas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reviews

### Crear reseña autenticada
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excelente experiencia, muy puntual y cómoda."
}

### Caso de falla 1: inyección SQL
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@aerorate.com' OR '1'='1",
  "password": "anything"
}

### Caso de falla 2: petición sin token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/mine

### Caso de falla 3: input inválido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "a",
  "email": "correo-invalido",
  "password": "12"
}
